                <pb facs="0041" n="11" sameAs="frus:frus1958-60v14/pg11"/>

                <head>2. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>The first Conference of Independent African States met at Accra, April 15–22. The
                    text of a message of April 14 from Secretary of State Dulles to Prime Minister Kwame Nkrumah, extending best wishes for the
                    conference, and the text of the joint declaration issued at Accra on April 22
                    are printed in <hi rendition="#italic">American Foreign Policy: Current
                        Documents, 1958, pages 1074–1075.</hi> Documentation relating to the
                    conference is in Department of State, Central File 770.00.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
